| the `4af62ae` in-lock `state` re-read deleted from `add_contended` alone | **FAILED** |
| `active()` cut to one shard | **FAILED** |
| after both restores | ok (0.28 s) |

Both restored byte-exact (`shasum -a 256 -c` OK, `git diff --exit-code -- crates/`
clean) and re-run after `touch`.

